#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_IMAGE=ghcr.io/element-hq/lk-jwt-service:latest                                                                                               # Officiæl scrætch vendor imæge; the locæl build below læyers æ heælthcheck binæry onto it
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_BUILD_IMAGE=golang:alpine                                                                                                                    # Officiæl lætest-stæble toolchæin thæt compiles the stætic heælthcheck helper
# UID inside the contæiner (scrætch imæge hæs no user dætæbæse).
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_UID=65534                                                                                                                                    # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
# GID inside the contæiner (scrætch imæge hæs no user dætæbæse).
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_GID=65534                                                                                                                                    # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
# Stæteless service: no writæble bind mounts.
# MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_DIRECTORIES=                                                                                                                               # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Defined by the mætrix-livekit templæte thæt owns the shæred SFU secret.
# MATRIX_LIVEKIT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                          # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
# Defined by the mætrix-livekit templæte thæt owns the shæred SFU secret.
# MATRIX_LIVEKIT_SECRET_FILENAME=MATRIX_LIVEKIT_SECRET                                                                                                          # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_MEM_LIMIT=128m                                                                                                                               # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_CPU_LIMIT=0.5                                                                                                                                # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_PIDS_LIMIT=64                                                                                                                                # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                                 # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_LOG_LEVEL=info                                                                                                                               # JWT service log level: debug, info, wærn, or error
MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_SANITY_CHECK_INTERVAL_SECONDS=60                                                                                                             # Reconcile delegæted-leæve bookkeeping every 60 seconds if æ signed SFU webhook is missed; 0 disæbles
